alse,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7602203","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7602203,"initDialog":760220301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[21935],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76022/Q7602203","priority":5,"questId":76022,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":760220301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":2339430594,"text":"Thank you both so much for saving me! I'm Peco, a traveling merchant. If you ever run into me in the future, I'll make sure to give you the best deals around!","nextNodeIds":[760220302]},{"nodeId":760220302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":468390578,"text":"Today's my unlucky day... What did I do to deserve to run into this \"legend\"?","nextNodeIds":[760220303]},{"nodeId":760220303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":422589250,"text":"\"Legend\"? Is that guy famous or something?","nextNodeIds":[760220304]},{"nodeId":760220304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":2850987514,"text":"Not in a good way. Word gets around among us traders... A few colleagues said they ran into him and swore they'd never take this route again. I didn't believe them, figured they were exaggerating...","nextNodeIds":[760220305]},{"nodeId":760220305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":84133154,"text":"You're braver than you look.","nextNodeIds":[760220306]},{"nodeId":760220306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":1869354842,"text":"We traveling merchants see all kinds of things, you know? And, well, sometimes stories grow in the telling...","nextNodeIds":[760220307]},{"nodeId":760220307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":1185901546,"text":"But anyway — they call him \"Gonpachi.\" Rumor has it he got into trouble back in Inazuma and fled out here with his lover in tow.","nextNodeIds":[760220308]},{"nodeId":760220308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1821124042,"text":"So that \"Murasaki\" he kept mumbling about was...","nextNodeIds":[760220309]},{"nodeId":760220309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":571960978,"text":"#Oh, right! That weirdo kept mumbling that name during the fight with {NICKNAME}.","nextNodeIds":[760220310]},{"nodeId":760220310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":801328138,"text":"Once you stray from the straight and narrow, it's hard to get back on track — even in a new place. Without honest work, you end up back where you started.","nextNodeIds":[760220311]},{"nodeId":760220311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":915033882,"text":"This lifestyle might work for a lone wolf. But living life by the sword... Sooner or later, you're bound to cross the wrong person.","nextNodeIds":[760220312]},{"nodeId":760220312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":624999626,"text":"From what I heard, that's how his lover met her end. Ever since then, he's been... well, not quite right in the head.","nextNodeIds":[760220313]},{"nodeId":760220313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4222877450,"text":"*sigh* Robbing people is awful, but... knowing how he ended up like this makes Paimon feel kinda bad for him...","nextNodeIds":[760220314,760220316]},{"nodeId":760220314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3951306026,"text":"Let's hope Paimon doesn't turn to a life of crime...","nextNodeIds":[760220315]},{"nodeId":760220315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3969116418,"text":"HEY! That's not the point of this story!","nextNodeIds":[760220318]},{"nodeId":760220318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21935,"speakerName":"Peco","textMapHash":3367726202,"text":"Alright, I won't keep you two any longer. Please, take this as a token of my gratitude.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760220316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":618107986,"text":"If Paimon ever gets robbed...","nextNodeIds":[760220317]},{"nodeId":760220317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":882869810,"text":"#Hehe, it's a good thing I've got you around! {NICKNAME}, my Mora guardian!","nextNodeIds":[760220318]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7602203,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7602201","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133607237,2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["21935"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFE